    "directions": [
      "Rinse the dal and put in pressure cooker. Pour 2 cups of water and cook for 7-8 whistles.",
      "Put fresh coconut in mixer and blend well. Make a fine paste, add water while blending.",
      "When the pressure goes off open the cooker and with ladle blend the dal to make batter type consistency.",
      "Heat ghee in a pan. Add mustard seeds and cumin seeds. When splutter add curry leaves and green chilies.",
      "Add tomatoes and cook well.",
      "Add the dal to the pan and mix well.",
      "Add water as required, turmeric, coconut paste, gud/jaggery and salt. Simmer the dal for 5-10mins.",
      "Serve hot with rice."
    ],
